### List movies
GET http://localhost:5000/api/movies?page=1&limit=10

### Search movies
GET http://localhost:5000/api/movies?q=Monsoon

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/movies/movies-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/movies
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Last Ticket",
  "language": "English",
  "genre": "Drama",
  "durationMins": 128,
  "certificate": "UA",
  "price": 249
}
